<title>USA: NationsBank says 1997 outlook looks good.</title>
<headline>NationsBank says 1997 outlook looks good.</headline>
<dateline>CHARLOTTE, N.C. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>NationsBank Corp spokeswoman Susan Carr said in a conference call with reporters on the first-quarter results that the business outlook for the remainder of 1997 &quot;looks very good&quot; and trends are &quot;positive across our franchise.&quot;</p>
<p>She said cost savings in the acquisition of Boatmen's Bancshares Inc met expectations that had been raised in January. NationsBank completed the $9.8 billion acquisition on January 7.</p>
</text>
